  * (B1, PC13, high while pressed). Hold USER while pressing RESET -> the next
  * mode after APP_POLICY_MODE in VC_DEMO_MODES; keep holding to step every
  * VC_MODE_STEP_MS; release to confirm. Not held -> APP_POLICY_MODE.
